 "remarks": "Amazing loft-style 1 bedroom condo in Clocktower! - Soaring ceilings and tons of natural light! - Exposed brick and wood beams! - Open kitchen layout with counter seating area, stainless steel appliances, and pantry! - Good closet and storage space - Shared laundry room just down the hall - Building features incredible courtyards, as well as a fitness center, sauna, pool table, lounge, community / event kitchen, and conference room - Off/street parking for 2 cars - Central location, just minutes to restaurants, shopping, and more! - Landlord to consider a pet on a case by case basis (must be under 25 lbs.)",
